    "text": "RETURN TO WORK PLAN - Please provide any additional return to work recommendations, including the duration of the program. Upon clearance for modified duties (estimated July 1), patient must be restricted to a 100% sedentary role (desk work only). No access to the warehouse floor due to the risk of exertion and emergency evacuation hazards. Begin with 4-hour shifts, 3 days a week. Patient must have immediate access to seating and permission to rest if experiencing palpitations or dizziness. No lifting over 5 kg. Reassessment required before advancing to 8-hour shifts.",
